Package: METAeDNA
Title: Integrates the eDNA Metabarcoding Analysis Workflow
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Anonymous", "Authors", email = "anonymous@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Anonymous Authors [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Anonymous Authors <anonymous@example.org>
Description: Processes environmental DNA (eDNA) metabarcoding reads and calculates taxon abundances and diversity. Functions merge paired reads, assign PCR reactions, collapse identical sequences, denoise reads, correct blank counts, build reference databases, and assign taxonomy. Sequence-processing functions use C++ with optional OpenMP parallelization. FASTA headers retain processing statistics and reaction counts as JSON metadata.
SystemRequirements: C++17, zlib
License: MIT + file LICENSE
